1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.5,"stats":{"hp":9000,"atk":500,"def":900,"res":10,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":3}},"famiglia_crossbowman":{"slug":"famiglia_crossbowman","name":"Famiglia Crossbowman","icon":"/enemies-icons/Famiglia Crossbowman.webp","rank":"Normal","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Ranged","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"Famiglia-trained crossbowmen, capable of striking from a distance. Crossbows for famiglia use are extremely sophisticated; when given emergency orders, these snipers will use basic Arts to complete their missions, not knowing where that knowledge came from.","abilities":["While under the Asset Liquidation status, attacks are converted into Arts damage"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":1,"stats":{"hp":4000,"atk":300,"def":200,"res":10,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":2.8}},"famiglia_caster":{"slug":"famiglia_caster","name":"Famiglia Caster","icon":"/enemies-icons/Famiglia Caster.webp","rank":"Normal","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Ranged","damageType":["Arts"],"flavourText":"For Famiglia-trained Casters, their Originium Arts are the basis of their standing within the famiglia. Though these Casters have fairly mediocre Arts, they at least are effective at inciting hatred.","abilities":["Attacks two targets simultaneously.","Can stop attacking to continually increase Blood Debt"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.8,"stats":{"hp":4500,"atk":320,"def":250,"res":40,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":3.5}},"vein_guardian":{"slug":"vein_guardian","name":"Vein Guardian","icon":"/enemies-icons/Vein Guardian.webp","rank":"Normal","race":"Arts Creation","movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Melee","damageType":["Arts"],"flavourText":"A deformed Infected Creature often found wandering around ore veins, stubbornly thinking they have a duty to guard the mine.","abilities":["More likely to be attacked by friendly units; when attacked, inflicts a certain amount of Arts damage to the attacker"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.6,"stats":{"hp":25000,"atk":400,"def":300,"res":10,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":4}},"famiglia_limo":{"slug":"famiglia_limo","name":"Famiglia Limo","icon":"/enemies-icons/Famiglia Limo.webp","rank":"Elite","race":"Machina","movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Melee","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"The famiglie's most common mode of transportation, sporting an interior as unassuming as the exterior, with only the bumper reinforced. In addition to transportation, they will also use this vehicle to bid 'buon viaggio' to their famiglia's enemies.","abilities":["Unloads 3 <Famiglia Soldiers> if this is unit is defeated while blocked"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":1.2,"stats":{"hp":10000,"atk":900,"def":1000,"res":15,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":5}},"famiglia_capo":{"slug":"famiglia_capo","name":"Famiglia Capo","icon":"/enemies-icons/Famiglia Capo.webp","rank":"Elite","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Melee","damageType":["Arts"],"flavourText":"A famiglia capo, highly respected and holding great power. Rumor has it that he never sets down his weapon, and though nobody knows where it might be hidden, some speculate that it may be inside his cigar.","abilities":["Increases Blood Debt whenever an enemy unit is defeated within range"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.7,"stats":{"hp":7500,"atk":500,"def":500,"res":25,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":2.5}},"famiglia_silencer":{"slug":"famiglia_silencer","name":"Famiglia Silencer","icon":"/enemies-icons/Famiglia Silencer.webp","rank":"Elite","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Ranged","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"A powerful assassin loyal to his famiglia, striking from the shadows before vanishing again, leaving only death in his wake. His title is known by all, but none dare speak of him.","abilities":["Gains additional buffs while under Asset Liquidation","Invisible"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.9,"stats":{"hp":12000,"atk":800,"def":800,"res":45,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":3}},"zaaro_signore_dei_lupi":{"slug":"zaaro_signore_dei_lupi","name":"Zaaro, Signore dei Lupi","icon":"/enemies-icons/Zaaro, Signore dei Lupi.webp","rank":"Boss","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Melee and Ranged","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"Il Signore dei Lupi was born in the wilderness, but he has cast his gaze upon the world of men. His hubris is boundless, yet he falls short. His tricks exhausted, he has lost everything. Now, someone must be made to bear his wrath.","abilities":["Gradually increases Blood Debt","First Form","Damage taken is reduced and cannot be Stunned","[Hemolytic Horror] Causes 3 friendly units to be consumed by fear, greatly reducing their ASPD, significantly accelerating their periodic HP loss, and causing them to be unable to be retreated manually; affected units will return to normal after 'Signore dei Lupi' loses a certain percentage of HP","After the first form reaches 0 HP, gains [Primal Deterrence], reducing the ASPD of nearby friendly units, and slowly gaining HP over time","Second Form","No longer has Damage Reduction, and longer casts [Hemolytic Horror]","Attacks become ranged and strike twice, and gains increased ATK","Periodically releases a [Furious Howl], causing Blood Debt to increase rapidly"],"levelCount":2,"level":1,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.6,"stats":{"hp":50000,"atk":1000,"def":13